        "category": "classfeature",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You gain <strong>Mass</strong> in two separate pools &mdash; <strong>1 Gem Mass</strong> and <strong>1 Metal Mass</strong> at 1st level &mdash; and the two activities that manage them, <em>Feed</em> and <em>Shed</em>. A Substrate at <strong>Depth N costs N Mass</strong>, and your <strong>Depth cap</strong> is 1.</p><p><strong>Depth 1&ndash;2 takes an ordinary specimen</strong> &mdash; a looted ruby, a copper ingot, a pearl off a necklace. <strong>Depth 3&ndash;4 takes a quickened specimen</strong>, one that grew somewhere the mundane world doesn't reach; those are never shop inventory.</p><p><strong>The Vein provides.</strong> Every time your Mass increases, you gain <strong>one free Substrate</strong> of any kind you qualify for.</p><p><em>Everything you have eaten is kept in the Gullet, which Feed and Shed open.</em></p>"
